  <section data-label="Example: skills" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #16a34a;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">16</span>Example</p>
          <h2 class="h2">A skill the agent applies <span class="accent">itself</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 32px; align-content: start;">

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">Claude Code</span>
          <div class="ide">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">.claude/skills/release-notes/SKILL.md</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="cmt">---</span>
<span class="key">name</span>: release-notes
<span class="key">description</span>: <span class="str">Generate release notes</span>
  <span class="str">from the git log since the previous tag.</span>
<span class="cmt">---</span>
1. Read the git log
2. Group by change type
3. Write a changelog</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">The agent picks the skill itself when you ask for release notes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">Cursor</span>
          <div class="ide">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">.cursor/skills/pr-review/SKILL.md</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="cmt">---</span>
<span class="key">name</span>: pr-review
<span class="key">description</span>: <span class="str">Review a PR thoroughly</span>
  <span class="str">for bugs, tests and style.</span>
<span class="cmt">---</span>
Read the diff, check the tests
and give a short list of
findings.</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">Run with <code>/pr-review</code> or let the agent choose it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">GitHub Copilot</span>
          <div class="ide">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">.github/skills/test-login/SKILL.md</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="cmt">---</span>
<span class="key">name</span>: test-login
<span class="key">description</span>: <span class="str">Test the login page</span>
  <span class="str">end-to-end.</span>
<span class="cmt">---</span>
Open the page, log in and
check the error messages.</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">Same SKILL.md format, also in Copilot.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Description = the trigger. <strong>The agent applies the right skill</strong> without you re-explaining the workflow.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
